🟢 LEVEL 1 — NMAP FUNDAMENTALS
1. Nmap kya hai?
Nmap = Network Mapper
Nmap ek network scanning/reconnaissance tool hai jo mainly ye identify karne ke liye use hota hai:

Host alive hai?
        ↓
Kaunse ports open hain?
        ↓
Kaunsi services chal rahi hain?
        ↓
Service ka version kya hai?
        ↓
OS kya ho sakta hai?


🛡️ SOC mein Nmap kyun important hai?
SOC Analyst ko network mein pata hona chahiye:

Kaunse systems exist karte hain
Kaunse ports exposed hain
Kaunsi services running hain
Koi unauthorized service toh nahi
Network baseline mein kya change hua


